  <p><strong>Effective 13 August 2026.</strong></p>
  <h2>Use and safety</h2>
  <p>Chef assists with meal planning, recipes and grocery preparation. Check all ingredients, allergens, nutrition, quantities, prices, product availability and product labels yourself.</p>
  <p>Chef is not medical, nutritional or allergy advice. Generated output must never be the only safety check. Confirm allergies and safety needs with the affected person and seek appropriate professional advice when needed.</p>

  <h2>Optional Computer Use</h2>
  <p>Computer Use is a capability-gated beta. Users must review and approve the grocery plan, then separately approve any basket mutation. Checkout, payment, fulfilment, restricted products and order placement are outside Chef's scope and remain human-controlled.</p>
  <p>Chef is independent software. It is not sponsored, endorsed or approved by Coles, Woolworths or any other retailer. Users are responsible for complying with each provider's terms and applicable law.</p>

